  {
    "id": "97b78a95-7abf-413d-be11-2781529f30ea",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_HEADING",
    "content": {
      "html": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center\">One Way Dual Language Program</h1>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "ab72d04b-0be2-4c56-a9ad-4f81866d1330",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_SEPARATOR"
  },
  {
    "id": "bc9027b3-7e1a-4b2e-840a-c103e741a65c",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_SPACER"
  },
  {
    "id": "25461dec-19e0-4e13-b132-168a44062aff",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_TEXT",
    "content": {
      "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px\">Alief ISD offers the <strong>One Way Dual Language Program (OWDL)</strong> to all of our incoming Kinder students who meet the state’s qualification standard for qualification to the required Bilingual Education Program.&nbsp;</span></p>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "864bade5-5ff5-45e6-a9d9-f2841561cace",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_TEXT",
    "content": {
      "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px\"><strong>Thank you for making the smart choice by partnering with Alief ISD to provide the best quality education available for your child!&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px\"><strong>&nbsp;For enrollment information, please </strong></span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"/o/aisd/page/enroll\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px\"><strong>Visit Enroll</strong></span></a></p>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "588fb406-ed41-4bd7-a97b-c9ff5aa2d901",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_SPACER"
  },
  {
    "id": "3344acb5-cd40-475b-a317-d3a95830226a",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_HEADING",
    "content": {
      "html": "<h2>Program Description</h2>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "dff1bda6-1c7f-47d7-9ba6-f59df9262c72",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_TEXT",
    "content": {
      "html": "<p> The <strong>OWDL program</strong> is a bilingual program in which native Spanish-speaking students use their primary language and English to learn content and language.&nbsp;</p>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "b409f543-c5b1-461d-9d41-95501f386321",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_HEADING",
    "content": {
      "html": "<h2>Model Design </h2>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "9b67504e-414d-4855-a472-606ad9e34a0f",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_TEXT",
    "content": {
      "html": "<p>The Alief <strong>OWDL</strong> program aims for 50% instruction in the student’s primary language, Spanish, and 50% of the instruction in English. </p>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "c34c54a3-da8d-46ad-9e3b-f465e00d942e",
